"To identify a cell's column, match the value to the column letter in the "
"header row — do not guess."
msgstr ""
"Chun colún cille a aithint, meaitseáil an luach leis an litir cholúin sa ró "
"ceanntásca — ná buille faoi thuairim."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:3926
msgid ""
"Reference a cell by combining its column header with the row number (e.g., "
"column B + row 2 = B2)."
msgstr ""
"Déan tagairt do chill trí cheanntásc a colúin a chomhcheangal le huimhir an "
"ró (m.sh., colún B + ró 2 = B2)."

