"values deviates significantly from the expected distribution, which may "
"suggest data manipulation."
msgstr ""
"Sáruithe ar Dhlí Benford — seiceáil an bhfuil dáileadh na ndigit tosaigh de "
"luachanna uimhriúla ag diall go suntasach ón dáileadh ionchais, rud a "
"d'fhéadfadh a thabhairt le fios go bhfuil ionramháil sonraí ann."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:3946
msgid ""
"Statistical outliers — identify values that deviate significantly from "
"their column or group."
msgstr ""
"Eiseachtaigh staitistiúla — aithnigh luachanna a imríonn go suntasach óna "
"gcolún nó óna ngrúpa."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:3952
msgid ""
"General anomalies — suspicious patterns, unexpected duplicates, "
"inconsistencies, or formatting issues."
msgstr ""
"Neamhrialtachtaí ginearálta — patrúin amhrasacha, dúblaigh gan choinne, "
"neamhréireachtaí, nó fadhbanna formáidithe."

